<title>SYRIA: Syria sells 15,000 tonnes of wheat to Turkey.</title>
<headline>Syria sells 15,000 tonnes of wheat to Turkey.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Establishment for Cereal Processing and Trade (GECPT) has sold 15,000 tonnes of hard durum amber wheat to Turkish companies at $191.1 per tonne,a company spokesman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>He said the wheat would be ready for shipment between April 15 and May 15.</p>
<p>The amount was part of 50,000 tonnes originally offered for sale by the GECPT on March 4.</p>
